/**
Creates a new instance of the {@link PortRelocationHandle} class.
@param graph The graph or `null`. If the graph instance is not specified, the handle will try to receive the graph from the {@link IInputModeContext}
it is passed in during {@link PortRelocationHandle.initializeDrag}.
@param edge The edge.
@param sourceEnd if set to `true` the source end will be subject to relocation, otherwise it will be the target port.*/
