/**
Creates a new object that is a copy of the current instance.
Immutable subclasses should consider returning `this`.

@returns A new object that is a copy of this instance using {@link YObject.memberwiseClone}.*/
clone(): this;
/**
Creates the visual.
This method is called in response to a {@link IVisualCreator.createVisual} call to the instance that has been
queried from the {@link StripeStyleBase.renderer}.

@param context
@param stripe The stripe to which this style instance is assigned.
@returns The visual as required by the {@link IVisualCreator.createVisual} interface.
@see {@link StripeStyleBase.updateVisual}*/
