/**
Delegates the calculation of the hierarchic layout to a configured {@link HierarchicLayoutCore} instance.
{@link HierarchicLayout} applies its own configuration to {@link HierarchicLayoutCore} and also
prepares the graph for layout.

## Note

The given graph will not be copied during the layout process and the layout will be immediately applied to the given
graph.

@param graph the input graph*/
