/**
Perform complete-linkage (or maximum-linkage) clustering.
The distance between two clusters is determined by the _maximum_ distance. Clusters thus are as close as the pair of nodes that
are _furthest away_ from each other.*/
COMPLETE,
/**
Perform mean-linkage (or average-linkage) clustering.
The distance between two clusters is the _average_ distance between each pair of nodes.*/
AVERAGE
